 "notes": "DIT SA Standard Road Sign Index sheet (A4, legends and dimensions outlined, colour legend; size from the sheet's size table = register). Every dimension from the sheet; AS 1744 (plus0) spacing. R5-SA102 225 x 450 (2020, 1:5), R25, black on white, no border. Bicycle symbol R7-1-4 at 20 % (90 wide: 67/90/68), 20 from the top, 60 high; LANE 35 E baseline 135 (55 below), ink 134 (45/134/46); time lines 50 E, baselines 250 (115 below) and 310 (60 pitch), AM / PM 15 E on the baselines; MON - FRI 20 E baseline 340 (30 below); double arrow R5-14 155 x 32, 13 from the bottom (65 below the MON - FRI baseline), 35/155/35. The numerals' horizontal positions are not dimensioned: placed where the sheet draws them (measured at 1200 dpi). Sheet note: panel times are for illustration only — the example is drawn, no time variants. Symbol and arrow reused from the national set."
